@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/streams/
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "背景表演者\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/streams/
alt 常规流量 (没有 direct_user_uuid)
    API -> DB: STREAM + TOPIC 默认 + 拥有者的绑定
else 直接流动 (其他用户)
    API -> DB: 强迫性 private=true\n确定对 + 两个用户独一无二的绑定
else 流动与自己 (direct_user_uuid == owner)
    API -> DB: 强迫性 private=true\n只有一个主人的链接到流/主题
end
API -> DB: 在此中添加不可更改的记录 transactional outbox
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable topic_membership_policy_rebuild /\nfolder_projection / read_counters\n单独的 outbox event -> 一个 task
Worker -> Worker: claim exact scope; 为了 topic work\nMESSAGE.created_at DESC
Worker -> Projection: 连接用户到流/主题/文件
Worker -> Events: stream.created + folder.updated\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
@enduml
